SUMMARY:ACNP 65th Annual Meeting 2027
DESCRIPTION:The 65th ACNP Annual Meeting runs Sunday through Wednesday\, 
 January 10 to 13\, 2027\, at the Manchester Grand Hyatt in San Diego. At
 tendance is by membership or invitation\, and poster abstract submission
  requires prior meeting registration.\n\nDeadlines\nTravel award applica
 tion: 2026-05-14\nPanel\, mini-panel and study group chair submission: 2
 026-05-19\nPanel presenter abstracts due: 2026-06-02\nPanel\, mini-panel
  and study group final submission: 2026-06-04\nMember invited guest invi
 tation requests: 2026-08-26\nPoster abstract submission: 2026-08-27\nPro
 mising Targets abstract submission: 2026-10-28\n\nhttps://acnp.org/annua
 l-meeting/
LOCATION:San Diego\, California\, Manchester Grand Hyatt San Diego
URL:https://acnp.org/annual-meeting/
